      "message": "nit: just a thought: maybe instead of this `#else` it would be more clear to have `#endif` followed by `#ifdef __PKVM_HYP__` (with an empty line between them :)), since this cache tag assign doesn\u0027t relate to this copied_context_tear_down() in any way?",
